Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, it's a new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了  这是全新的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All that stuff about Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于瑞秋的那件事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:13.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't feel that now. It was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:13.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你没那种感觉了  那简直太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're fine. You're better than fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没事  你好的不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are, as your friend Tony would say, "Great!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就像朋友汤尼说的那样  "棒极了"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everything's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切都很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's just your friend, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她只是你的朋友  瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your friend, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的朋友瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your friend. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的朋友瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:39.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, it's your girlfriend, Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:39.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  她是你女朋友瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:43.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E13 The One Where Chandler Takes a Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:43.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第13集  钱德的泡泡浴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:28.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you...? Are you high?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:28.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你...你磕嗨了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:32.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just had the most amazing bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:32.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚泡了一个超舒服的澡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? I don't like baths.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:34.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  我不喜欢泡澡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:36.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. You like them with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:36.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你喜欢跟我泡鸳鸯浴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, it's not the bath I enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  我喜欢的不是泡澡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the wet, naked lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是喜欢看全身湿答答的裸体女人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:43.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Baths are so relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:43.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泡澡能让你全身放松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:45.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  你在里面做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.01,0:01:47.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just sit in there, stewing in your own filth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.01,0:01:47.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过是坐在浴缸里  泡着自己洗过的脏水
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:51.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How dirty do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:51.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得我能有多脏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:55.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you if you had some candles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:55.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你点上蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:57.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and some bubbles and some music, you would love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:57.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}配上泡泡跟音乐  你一定会爱上泡澡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:00.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It would take all of your stress away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:00.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能帮你解除压力  一身轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:02.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, it's 2:00 on a Wednesday and I'm watching Road Rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:02.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在是星期三下午两点  我正在看越野单车赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.67,0:02:04.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How stressed do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.67,0:02:04.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得我的压力会有多大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:12.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got a minute? I really need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:12.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有空吗  我真的需要跟你谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Is this a coldpizza talk
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  这场谈话是要配冷披萨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:16.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or a leftovermeat loaf talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:16.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是配剩肉卷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:17.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:17.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:20.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:20.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  发生了什么大事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lately, I've been feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最近我觉得...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:30.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:30.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:38.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I feel a lot better. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:38.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗  我觉得好多了  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:42.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:42.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快回来告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and Monica, friends for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟莫妮卡当了很久的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:51.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And sure, there are rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:51.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然这是有规则的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:54.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then you went to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:54.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之后你们去了伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But that's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是那不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are rules there too, you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也是有规则的  你理解我的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你自己理解吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.77,0:03:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was different for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.77,0:03:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们的情况和我不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:08.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you were both in the same place, right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:08.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们刚好在同一个地方  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:09.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} In London?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:09.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在伦敦  对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:12.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, when Monica and I were in London, we were both in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:12.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  莫妮卡跟我在伦敦时我们刚好都在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.18,0:03:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what. This is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.18,0:03:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就不该来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:17.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget it. Forget all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:17.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了  就当我什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:20.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And listen, do me a favor, this conversation between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:20.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我个忙  别把这件事说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:22.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:22.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会尽力的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:32.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Ross, don't forget we have that doctor's appointment tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:32.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  别忘了明天我们要一起去产检
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.05,0:03:34.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Right.  Hey, are you going to find out the sex of the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.05,0:03:34.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  你们要知道宝宝的性别了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. We talked about it. We don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我们不想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All we care about is that it's happy and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只在乎宝宝是不是健康快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep, happy and healthy. And cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  健康快乐  还有可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} And smart.  Popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:42.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聪明  万人迷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With an aptitude for science.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还要有科学精神
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:46.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you two talking about the same baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:46.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们两个说的是同一个宝宝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:51.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, have you thought of names yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:51.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们开始想名字了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. I've come up with a bunch of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我想到一大堆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Really? Me too.  Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  我也是  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:56.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:56.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:04:01.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it's a girl, Phoebe. And if it's a boy, Pheebo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:04:01.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果是女孩就叫菲比  如果是男孩就叫菲宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:05.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:05.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:09.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it wouldn't hurt to have a backup, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:09.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但多想些备用名字应该有益无害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:12.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Rach, what were you thinking?  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:12.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  你都想到什么名字  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was thinking if it's a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想如果是女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...how about Sandrene? It's French.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫她珊德妮好吗  这是法文
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a really pretty name for an industrial solvent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很适合做工业溶剂公司的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:29.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, fine. What do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:29.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  你想到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:30.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's for a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:30.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想到一个男孩的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know it's a little out there, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道起这个名字有点疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Darwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}达尔文
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Our child will be beaten to death in the schoolyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我们的孩子会在操场上被打死
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:43.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, by Sandrene.
