Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:11.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:11.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm in the bathroom. Can you come in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在浴室  你能进来一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think there's something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:18.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I think I'll wait out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:18.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是在这里等着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm in the bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在浴缸里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I drew my own bath, but I did it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我自己放了洗澡水  但方法不对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:31.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The water's tepid, the salt didn't dissolve
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:31.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}水不冷不热  浴盐没有溶解
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:34.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and is now lodged places.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:34.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在都结块了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the scents I used don't compliment each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:37.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我用的几种香料闻起来很不协调
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eucalyptus and chamomile?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}桉树加甘菊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What?  Bath salts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  浴盐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:46.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're starting to effervesce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:46.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始冒泡了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:48.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:48.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:51.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:51.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这感觉真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:55.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Let's talk about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:55.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我们谈谈别的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:58.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Sure. So, what was going on with you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:58.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  今天你过得还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I actually had the weirdest conversation with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊今天跟我聊了一些很奇怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:08.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was talking about rules and right and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:08.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他谈到规则  还有对错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had the exact same conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也跟他谈过这些
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did? What was he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗  他到底在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:15.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. Joey hasn't had this much trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:15.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自从他演过《麦克白》之后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}getting out words since we saw him in Macbeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还没见过他说不出话的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was a long night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那可真是漫长的一夜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:24.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, let's break this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:24.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我们来分析一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What exactly did he say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他到底跟你说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:28.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. He was talking about rules
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:28.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说到规则
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.03,0:10:31.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and looking at people differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.03,0:10:31.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对别人有了不同的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He didn't say anything about that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有跟我说那个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:34.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What'd he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:34.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟你说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was asking all this questions about you, me and London.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他问到你跟我在伦敦发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And of course the glue that holds this all together, the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从头至尾都在谈规则
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:45.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. So you, me and London.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:45.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  你跟我在伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:47.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Looking at people differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:47.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对别人有不同的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:52.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe he wants to do what you and I did in London with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许他想跟某人发生你跟我在伦敦所做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But what'd he mean by "rules"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他说"规则"是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:59.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. He stopped talking the minute Phoebe came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:59.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下  菲比走进来时  他就不说了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:00.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because he was looking at her differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:00.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他对她的感觉不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:02.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Phoebe is his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:02.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比是他的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So he thinks that would be breaking the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他觉得那样违反了规则
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My God, he wants to do it with Phoebe in London!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  他想跟菲比在伦敦上床
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You guys?  Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在哪里  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:14.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's Mrs. Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}崔比安尼太太来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么都别说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would I say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为什么要说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That two of our friends could start
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的两个好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the greatest love affair of their lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就要展开一段伟大恋情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They would have me to thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们将来可要谢我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then we could all start having babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后我们可以一起开始怀孕生孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:29.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna let you say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:29.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不准你告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.57,0:11:30.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.57,0:11:30.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:32.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Monica, I brought back your iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  我拿熨斗来还你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you had that? I thought I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你拿走的吗  我还以为我弄丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:43.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got a new one a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:43.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个月前  我买了个新的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:45.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, just as well. I broke this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:45.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了  我把这个弄坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:53.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What?  Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:53.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么  没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:54.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:54.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:59.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really shouldn't say. I'm really not supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:59.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我实在不该说  我不该说出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:00.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:00.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a humdinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可是个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then it's really too bad that you can't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可惜你不能告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody likes you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是钱德勒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} No!  Then tell him to stop staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  那叫他别再盯着我看了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:25.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Joey? You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:25.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  乔伊  看不出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it something you'd be interested in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你对他有意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:29.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:29.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道  我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I mean, on the one hand, "Mother, may I?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一方面会想"天啊  我可以跟他在一起吗"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:38.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, you know, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:38.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但另一方面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:44.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, I can't. We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:44.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.77,0:12:47.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no. I don't wanna risk what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.77,0:12:47.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  我不能拿我们现在的友谊冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think you're gonna talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要跟他谈一谈吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.07,0:12:54.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure. I mean, it's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.07,0:12:54.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  他可是乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want him to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不希望他受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:12:59.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I must say, I am on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:12:59.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我简直是势不可挡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}First Chandler, now Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先是钱德勒  现在又是乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Not Chandler. Just Joey.  Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有钱德勒  只有乔伊  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I've been thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗  我想过了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:20.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm really coming around on the name Ruth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:20.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我开始接受萝丝这个名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:23.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I would actually consider naming our child that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得可以考虑帮孩子取那个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, I can't tell you how much that means to me.
